┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸲ taken off this page on 2026-08-31: a subprocess helper is not
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸲ about identity, and there is no helpers page for it yet. The
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸲ call still happens -- repo_remote_url invokes it -- so this
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸲ page shows one arrow fewer than the code makes. Put them back
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸲ when a helpers page exists, or leave the note when it does not.
