┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Checked byte for byte before they were deleted: ten
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ vectors × six styles × three protocols × three depths
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ × three sources, 1730 comparisons, zero differences.
┋┋┋ ━ THE FIVE THAT WENT NOWHERE
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The plan had been for Claude-Colophon to take them. It shipped without a hook at all, so nothing was ever going to call them.
┋┋┋┋ ━ emit and hooks, removed
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ cmd_emit                 printed the mark at a turn's end
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ cmd_hooks                printed a settings.json snippet
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ payload_cwd              read a cwd off stdin
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ open_output              opened the controlling tty
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ RETURN_OF_CONTROL_EVENTS the four event names
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ A hook registration is a side effect in a file outside
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ this repository; the other three are properties of one
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ caller rather than of a rendering.
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $number=7.3
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $fn=gone_hook
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $kind=data
