┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ `--style icon` was the only producer of one, and no
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ artifact holds it. The committed sizes are 27, 104,
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ 128 and 256, so an inline-image consumer must
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ re-derive or resample.
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ 40 is five cells of eight, chosen because Konsole
┊┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ ignores the protocol's own width and height.
