┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=1.1.5
┋┋┋ ━ stored seed
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=str | None
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The identiconSeed field. Written when it is not set and never rewritten, so a rename, a move between forges and a clone all leave it alone.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=1.1.3
┋┋┋ ━ seed history
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=list[str]
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ identiconSeedHistory: the seeds this repository had before the current one, most recent first. Nothing derives from it.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=6.1
┋┋┋ ━ colour map
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=int
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ Which colour rule drew this repository, recorded in settings.json and never hashed. Currently 0. A new map repaints every mark and reshapes none.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.3.6
┋┋┋ ━ seed source
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=str, one of four
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ What a derivation draws from: auto, repo, path or uuid. A named source that cannot answer raises rather than falling back.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=1.1.2
┋┋┋ ━ reseed
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=str | None
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The one act that moves a mark. Pushes the current seed onto the history and blanks the seed field; the ordinary rule then writes a new one.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=6.1
┋┋ ━ The mark
