┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.2.3
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.3.12
┋┋┋ ━ matrix
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=5×5 of bool
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ From digest characters 0–14, drawn down the centre column and mirrored outwards.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.2.1
┋┋┋ ━ hue
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=float, [0, 1)
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ A fraction of a turn, from the last seven digest characters.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.3.1
┋┋┋ ━ the warp
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $type=float° → float°
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸆ The raised-cosine reweighting that makes the hue advance faster through the blue-green arc.
┊┊┊┊ ┄ ⸖ $defines=2.3.2
